    "body": "I think I misread the original request. I think they wanted the whole module to return `None` if `gcloud_context.config_name` is `NONE`, which would be handled via a regular `if`-condition ahead of the `let parsed` part.:\r\n```\r\nif gcloud_context.config_name == \"NONE\" {\r\n    return None;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe documentation for this would need to be in the main description after `# Google Cloud`, like the conditions listed in the AWS module.",
